@buildthis.bisks.net: added a reviews tab/page to rateyourbuild — "your reviews" is one click away when signed in, and any handle or did gets its own /reviewer/ page listing every site they rated, public and shareable.

built it 🎉 — https://rateyourbuild.bisks.net

